            </div>


            <!-- =================================================
                 INFORMATION
                 ================================================= -->

            <div class="info">

                <strong>How it works</strong>

                <br />

                Two SuperFormula equations are combined
                to create a mathematical 3D surface.

                <br /><br />

                <strong>Mouse</strong>

                <br />

                Drag to rotate the object.

                <br />

                Mouse wheel to zoom.

            </div>


        </div>


        <!-- =====================================================
             3D VIEWER
             ===================================================== -->

        <div class="viewer">


            <div class="viewer-title">

                <h1>
                    SUPERFORMULA
                </h1>

                <p>
                    REAL-TIME MATHEMATICAL 3D
                </p>

            </div>


